http://www.bls.gov/oes/current/oes_nat.htm
). In this regard, Table 2 presents the mean hourly wage, the cost of fringe benefits and overhead (calculated at 100 percent of salary), and the adjusted hourly wage. The adjusted wages are used to derive our cost estimates.

