We estimate a one-time burden for applicable integrated plans to revise their systems for recordkeeping related to integrated grievances. We anticipate this task will take a software developer/programmer 3 hours at $98.54/hr. Three hours is consistent with the per-response time estimated in the May 2016 Medicaid Managed Care final rule (81 FR 27498). In aggregate, we estimate a one-time burden of 102 hours (3 hr × 34 contracts) at a cost of $10,051 (102 hr × $98.54/hr). Over the course of OMB's anticipated 3-year approval period, we estimate an annual burden of 34 hours (102 hr × 
1/3
